==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (2,000%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 98% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.
**10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (2,000%) spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 97% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns.
**1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 96% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns.
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.
**4 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Mr. (Special Cat)|Hyper Mr.]] or [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion]] can be used to separate the waves between the level. Other than that, use your usual [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-red cats]] and [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-alien cats]]: [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], etc.

